00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:20.651
[MUSIC]

00:13:20.651 --> 00:13:21.569
&gt;&gt; I love it.

00:13:21.569 --> 00:13:23.155
That does look like a cuboid.

00:13:23.155 --> 00:13:26.079
[MUSIC]

00:13:26.079 --> 00:13:26.579
&gt;&gt; We got it!

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:32.280
&gt;&gt; I've done better with math when I
was talking with people, sharing ideas.

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:34.710
&gt;&gt; Four or
five brains work better than one.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.997
&gt;&gt; I'll see it one way, but
then someone else will see it another way.

00:13:37.997 --> 00:13:41.485
And I'll be like, my gosh,
