00:13:46.144 --> 00:13:47.643
Because lots of problems in math,

00:13:47.643 --> 00:13:52.070
there are different answers
&gt;&gt; Have more than one way to solve

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:53.690
the question.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.665
&gt;&gt; because in real life,
you're not going to just do one thing.

00:13:56.665 --> 00:13:57.930
You're going to do many things.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:00.360
You're going to need to
